  "headline": "Government Opens 154,052 CPNS 2026 Positions Starting November 27",
  "seoTitle": "CPNS 2026 Recruitment Registration and Formation Details",
  "metaDescription": "Registration for the 2026 CPNS civil servant selection officially opens with 154,052 positions available through the government's SSCASN portal.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The 2026 CPNS civil service recruitment process officially launched on November 27 with 154,052 total positions available.",
    "Candidates can access formation details and submit required documentation through the official SSCASN digital portal.",
    "Member of Commission II of the House of Representatives, Azis Subekti, proposed limiting future recruitment eligibility to exclude high school graduates."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government has officially commenced the 2026 recruitment for Calon Pegawai Negeri Sipil (CPNS) as of November 27, offering a total of 154,052 civil service positions. Prospective applicants are directed to the official SSCASN portal to view available formations, document requirements, and instructions for examination procedures, including information regarding e-meterai for application documents. The selection process includes a basic competency test (SKD) consisting of 110 questions to be completed within 100 minutes. As part of the ongoing process, President Prabowo indicated that PPPK teachers over age 35 are eligible for specific designated formations. Meanwhile, debate continues regarding future eligibility, with Azis Subekti of the House of Representatives Commission II suggesting that future recruitment cycles should potentially exclude high school graduates to professionalize the public workforce further. Testing will be facilitated across 143 locations.",
  "whyItIsViral": "The recruitment opening is generating significant media interest, covered by four major outlets with high velocity due to the scale of the available positions.",
